── keys 82 of 82 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
── General ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
▌ ?       help                                                                  
  :       command palette                                                       
  q       close, or quit at the root                                            
  esc     back out one level                                                    
  ctrl+c  cancel the running command, else quit                                 
  u       undo                                                                  
  ctrl+r  redo                                                                  
  ctrl+l  reload from the source                                                
a key explains itself · / filters         enter run  / filter  ↑↓ move  esc back
